CMD  specifies the default container startup command
gunicorn   start the production WSGI server
--bind 0.0.0.0:8000  listens on port 8000 on all container IPV4 interfaces
--worker 2           starts two worker  processes
--timeout 30         configures the workeer timeout to 30 seconds after this                     fi the worker doesn't responds the worker will  be 
                     restarted
--error-logfile -    send error logs to standard error
--access-logfile -   send access logs logs to standard output
server               Loads the WSGI application from server.py expection an                      object named app



